  "design": {
    "decision": "Bid nil only with a partner who can safely make a contract, since both must succeed.",
    "opponent": "Revealed at scoring; opponents can deny it by breaking the nil or setting the partner.",
    "rationale": "Unlike nil points (seed-nil-points, -3.0), these are contract points and need the contract too, so the payoff rewards the safe nil-plus-made plan and is lost on a set.",
